                <invention-title lang="de">VIDEO-CODEC-GESTÜTZTE ECHTZEITVIDEOVERBESSERUNG UNTER VERWENDUNG VON TIEFENLERNEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AMÉLIORATION DE LA VIDÉO EN TEMPS RÉEL ASSISTÉE PAR CODEC VIDÉO GRÂCE À L'APPRENTISSAGE PROFOND</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VIDEO CODEC ASSISTED REAL-TIME VIDEO ENHANCEMENT USING DEEP LEARNING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Techniques related to accelerated video enhancement using deep learning selectively applied based on video codec information are discussed. Such techniques include applying a deep learning video enhancement network selectively to decoded non-skip blocks that are in low quantization parameter frames, bypassing the deep learning network for decoded skip blocks in low quantization parameter frames, and applying non-deep learning video enhancement to high quantization parameter frames.</p>
            </abstract>
